{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉穎鏇（Tiffany）不僅演藝事業搏殺，私底下更是一名超級孝順女。近日她特意抽空飛返美國，為最愛的婆婆慶祝生日，並在社交平台分享了幾張極具紀念價值的溫馨照片，瞬間融化大批網民的心。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1790171175_3992567497424351054_193721100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261CqLPdbTJT1790579613.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"itstiffanylau_1790171175_3992567497424351054_193721100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">照片中可見，Tiffany 準備了彩色氣球為婆婆賀壽，相片下方寫上「happy birthday porpor ❤️」，兩婆孫溫馨地貼頭擁抱，畫面極度有愛。另一張照片中，Tiffany 緊緊握住婆婆滿佈歲月痕跡的雙手，並配上「the best feeling（最好的感覺）」字句。簡單的一個牽手舉動，已經流露出她對婆婆深深的愛與牽掛，令人相當感動。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447189916375892_193721100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265pm6os3gcx1790579613.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447189916375892_193721100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447195049190983_193721100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VEKlkfAJfD1790579613.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447195049190983_193721100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了溫馨的婆孫互動，Tiffany 亦大方分享了自己回到美國放假時的輕鬆狀態。她上載了一張超近鏡的自拍美照，並標明是「no makeup days（素顏日）」。相中的她完全零底妝上陣，對著鏡頭展露甜美微笑，肌膚依然白滑透亮，五官精緻，完美展現出「天生麗質」的純天然美態。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447198723528955_193721100.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026DDjHb1yqOn1790579614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"itstiffanylau_1790514576_3995447198723528955_193721100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_d3485ca2764235f3-35\" style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T08:19:05.490319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":402,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}